    {
      "id": "claim_182e636e22f44968b638377185fee44b",
      "statement": "EncryptOnecommCards migrates plaintext card numbers out of payment2.transaction into a vault: per selected row it masks the number to xxx+last-4, computes cardNoHashed via Crypto.hmacSha256 under onecredit.hmac and cardNoEncrypted via Crypto.encryptAES under onecredit.aes (both url-safe base64), inserts those into payment2.tb_card_vault, and updates the transaction's s_card_number to the mask; it commits every 100 rows with auto-commit disabled and no rollback path, so a mid-run failure leaves partial writes committed.",
